          "note": "DevHub operations agent: lists, checks, and manages DevHub app cards over the DevHub MCP endpoint (https://hub.<DOMAIN>/api/mcp). Needs DOMAIN and DEVHUB_MCP_TOKEN in .env.\n\nMCP: https://hub.{{DOMAIN}}/api/mcp with Authorization \"Bearer {{$vars.DEVHUB_MCP_TOKEN}}\". Set DOMAIN and DEVHUB_MCP_TOKEN in .env and re-run builders-import; until then this agent cannot connect.\n\nModel: lab-chat through LiteLLM (credential \"Lab Model (LiteLLM)\", Base Path http://litellm:4000/v1 under Additional Parameters). The Model Name list only knows OpenAI model names, so it can look empty: leave it, the agent still uses lab-chat."
